 New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/49910cf1b599357b/clip_image002.gif?part=0.1\" width=\"384\" height=\"383\"></span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">I \nam curious as to what the 1.25/1.5 legend box is.</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">Here \nis the script, Data is attached:</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">rm(list=ls(all=TRUE))</span></span></font></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"> library(ggplot2)<br> library(mgcv)<br> library(MASS)<br> windows(height=4, \nwidth=4, record=TRUE)</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">datafall \n&lt;- \nread.csv(&quot;W://Resource/2011_Jan_June/Correia_Atlantic_Herring/fall_032_r4-5.32.csv&quot;, \nskip=1, header=TRUE)</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"> qplot(YEAR,MEAN.WEIGHT, \ndata=datafall,geom=c(&quot;point&quot;, &quot;smooth&quot;),<br>      \nmethod=&quot;gam&quot;, formula=y~s(x, bs=&quot;cs&quot;), lwd=1, cex=1.25,<br> main=&quot;Gulf of \nMaine <br>  Atlantic Herring Biomass <br>  MDMF Fall Survey, \nRegions 4-5&quot;, ylab=&quot;Stratified Mean Wt/Tow (kg)&quot;)</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">I \ndid a search for infor on this in google and couldn&#39;t come up with \nanything.  I also read your qplot pdf that is out there- Chapter2 from your \nbook &quot;Elegant Graphics for Data Analysis&quot; and did not catch \nit.</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">I \napologize if I missed it, if I did please just refer me back to the \nsource.</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">Much \nThanks for developing such great tools for us programming-challenged \nfolks.</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\"></span></span></font> </div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:12pt\">Vin</span></span></font></div>\n<div><font size=\"2\" face=\"Arial\"></font> </div>\n<div>\n<p><b><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Book Antiqua&#39;;color:#3366ff;font-size:11pt\">Vincent \nM. Manfredi</spa